B.ahq=new A.ks(u.v,null)
B.aht=new A.jG("If You have any questions about this Privacy Policy, You can contact Us:\n\u2022 Email: sivaprasadnk123@gmail.com\n\u2022 Website: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/qrcode\n\u2022 Privacy Policy URL: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/qrcode/privacy-policy",null)
B.ahu=new A.ks("We do not sell, trade, rent, or share Your personal data with third parties or advertisers. All downloaded files and local download history are stored strictly on Your Device and can be deleted at any time from the in-app Library tab, Your Device gallery/file manager, or by uninstalling YT Downloader.",null)
B.ahv=new A.jG("\u2022 No Personal Data Collected: QR Code Studio does not require You to create an account and does not collect, store, sell, or share any personally identifiable information (such as Your name, phone number, email address, contacts, or GPS location) on external servers.\n\u2022 100% On-Device QR Generation & Scanning: All QR codes You generate (including text, URLs, custom patterns, corner eye styles, and color palettes) and all QR codes You scan (via live camera or uploaded images) are processed 100% locally on Your Device. None of the text, links, or images You enter or scan are ever uploaded or transmitted to any external server.",null)
B.ahw=new A.ks("If You have any questions about this Privacy Policy, You can contact Us:\n\u2022 Developer: Sivaprasad NK\n\u2022 Email: sivaprasadnk123@gmail.com\n\u2022 Website: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/yt-downloader\n\u2022 Privacy Policy URL: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/yt-downloader/privacy-policy",null)
B.ahx=new A.jG("\u2022 Application: Refers to QR Code Studio (dev.sivaprasadnk.qr_code_studio_mobile), the QR code generator and scanner software program provided by the Developer.\n\u2022 Developer / We / Us / Our: Refers to Sivaprasad NK, Kerala, India.\n\u2022 Device: Means any device that can access the Service such as a smartphone, tablet, or computer.\n\u2022 Personal Data: Any information that relates to an identified or identifiable individual.",null)
B.ahy=new A.kr("We do not sell, trade, rent, or share Your personal data with third parties or advertisers. Because Your alarms, timers, and preferences are stored locally on Your Device, You can delete all data at any time by deleting items inside the ChronoCraft app or clearing the app storage / uninstalling ChronoCraft from Your Device.",null)
B.ahz=new A.kr("To function reliably as a clock, alarm, and timer utility, ChronoCraft may request standard OS permissions:\n\u2022 Exact Alarms (SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM / USE_EXACT_ALARM): Used strictly to trigger Your scheduled alarms and countdown timers at the exact time You specify.\n\u2022 Notifications & Full-Screen Intent (POST_NOTIFICATIONS / USE_FULL_SCREEN_INTENT): Used to display active timer progress and alarm alerts when the screen is locked.\n\u2022 Foreground Service & Wake Lock (FOREGROUND_SERVICE / WAKE_LOCK): Used to keep active timers, stopwatches, and ringing alarms running reliably.\n\u2022 Receive Boot Completed (RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED): Used to automatically reschedule enabled alarms after Your Device restarts.\n\u2022 Vibration & Audio Settings (VIBRATE): Used to play alarm tones and vibration patterns.",null)
B.ahB=new A.kr(u.P,null)
B.ahA=new A.jG(u.P,null)
B.ahC=new A.ks("\u2022 No Personal Data Collected: YT Downloader does not require You to create an account and does not collect, store, sell, or share any personally identifiable information (such as Your name, phone number, email address, contacts, browsing history, or GPS location) on developer-operated servers.\n\u2022 100% Local Processing: All URL parsing, stream extraction, audio/video muxing, thumbnail export, closed-caption (.vtt) generation, and file management occur 100% locally on Your Device.",null)
B.ahD=new A.kr("Our Service is a general-audience timekeeping utility and does not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from anyone, including children under the age of 13.",null)
B.ahE=new A.kr("\u2022 Application: Refers to ChronoCraft, the clock, alarm, timer, and stopwatch software program provided by the Developer.\n\u2022 Developer / We / Us / Our: Refers to Sivaprasad NK, Kerala, India.\n\u2022 Device: Means any device that can access the Service such as a smartphone, tablet, or wearable device.\n\u2022 Personal Data: Any information that relates to an identified or identifiable individual.",null)
B.ahF=new A.kr("\u2022 No Personal Data Collected: ChronoCraft does not require You to create an account and does not collect, store, sell, or share any personally identifiable information (such as Your name, phone number, email address, contacts, or GPS location) on external servers.\n\u2022 Locally Stored App Data: All clock configurations, alarms, alarm labels, timers, stopwatch laps, selected world clock time zones, and theme/display preferences are stored locally on Your Device. This data never leaves Your Device.",null)
